<speak>For the transaction currency, I have Chinese yuan in mind. Let me finish reviewing the arrangements before I settle the instruction. On the administration, I have been thinking about travel. I would like to be less tied to the house, but I do not want to take a travelling office with me. In the past I carried a bag of papers everywhere because there was always something from the business that might need attention. I have no desire to replace that with a bag of banking correspondence.</speak>